tly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".\n\nDATA (build the UI around this content):\n{\n  \"persona\": {\n    \"name\": \"Mira Kovač\",\n    \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n    \"city\": \"Ljubljana\",\n    \"bio\": \"I design calm, usable software for public services and small teams. Ten years across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping.\",\n    \"availability\": \"Open to freelance work from January\",\n    \"email\": \"mira@example.com\",\n    \"links\": [\n      \"Dribbble\",\n      \"LinkedIn\",\n      \"Read.cv\"\n    ],\n    \"stats\": [\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Years designing\",\n        \"value\": \"10\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Products shipped\",\n        \"value\": \"24\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"People reached\",\n        \"value\": \"1.2M\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"skills\": [\n      \"Interaction design\",\n      \"User research\",\n      \"Design systems\",\n      \"Prototyping\",\n      \"Service design\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"projects\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Transit app redesign\",\n      \"year\": 2026,\n      \"role\": \"Lead designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Ljubljana Public Transport\",\n      \"summary\": \"Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"App store rating rose from 3.4 to 4.6 in six months.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"mobile\",\n        \"research\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Clinic booking system\",\n      \"year\": 2025,\n      \"role\": \"Product designer\",\n      \"client\": \"Zdravje Clinics\",\n      \"summary\": \"Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"58% fewer booking calls; 91% of patients book online.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"web\",\n        \"service design\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Open data dashboard\",\n      \"year\": 2024,\n      \"role\": \"Design and front-end\",\n      \"client\": \"City of Ljubljana\",\n      \"summary\": \"City budget explorer used by 30k residents.\",\n      \"outcome\": \"Featured by two national newspapers; open-sourced.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"data viz\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"testimonial\": {\n    \"quote\": \"Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.\",\n    \"author\": \"Tina Zupan\",\n    \"role\": \"Head of Digital, LPP\"\n  }\n}","systemHash":"7f7b03405c279f095db892fdd24437dfc241ff3c8abb65e91da9e557823238ce","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .portfolio-hero { padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); border-radius: 1.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(65, 116, 94, .14), rgba(65, 116, 94, .035) 58%, transparent); }\n  .portfolio-mark { width: 3rem; height: 3rem; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(65, 116, 94, .15); font-weight: 700; }\n  .project-card { min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .project-card .project-bottom { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 1.25rem; }\n  .project-index { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; letter-spacing: .08em; }\n  .quote-mark { font-size: 3rem; line-height: 1; opacity: .55; }\n</style>\n\n<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n    <a class=\"row center gap-sm\" href=\"#top\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\">\n      <span class=\"portfolio-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">MK</span>\n      <span><strong>Mira Kovač</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Independent product designer</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"row center gap-sm\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"#work\">Selected work</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" href=\"#about\">About</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" href=\"#contact\">Get in touch</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"portfolio-hero stack gap-lg\" id=\"top\" aria-labelledby=\"intro-title\">\n    <div class=\"row between center gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\">PRODUCT DESIGNER · LJUBLJANA, SLOVENIA</p>\n        <h1 id=\"intro-title\">Making complex services feel simple.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">I design calm, usable software for public services and small teams. Ten years across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping.</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#work\">Explore selected work</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"mailto:mira@example.com\">Email Mira</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\" style=\"min-width:min(100%, 15rem)\">\n        <span class=\"badge\">Available for projects</span>\n        <strong>Open to freelance work from January</strong>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Based in Ljubljana · Working with thoughtful teams everywhere</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-sm\" aria-label=\"Career highlights\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Years designing</div><div class=\"stat-value\">10</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stat-label\">Products shipped</div><div class=\"stat-value\">24</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"stat-label\">People reached</div><div class=\"stat-value\">1.2M</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-lg\" id=\"work\" aria-labelledby=\"work-title\">\n    <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">A FEW RECENT COLLABORATIONS</p>\n        <h2 id=\"work-title\">Selected work</h2>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">2024—2026</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n      <article class=\"card project-card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"small muted project-index\">01 / 03</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">2026</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"h3\">Transit app redesign</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Lead designer · Ljubljana Public Transport</p>\n        <p>Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.</p>\n        <div class=\"project-bottom stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"alert\"><strong>Outcome:</strong> App store rating rose from 3.4 to 4.6 in six months.</div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">mobile</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">research</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card project-card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"small muted project-index\">02 / 03</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">2025</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"h3\">Clinic booking system</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Product designer · Zdravje Clinics</p>\n        <p>Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.</p>\n        <div class=\"project-bottom stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"alert\"><strong>Outcome:</strong> 58% fewer booking calls; 91% of patients book online.</div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">web</span><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">service design</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card project-card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"small muted project-index\">03 / 03</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">2024</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"h3\">Open data dashboard</h3>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Design and front-end · City of Ljubljana</p>\n        <p>City budget explorer used by 30k residents.</p>\n        <div class=\"project-bottom stack gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"alert\"><strong>Outcome:</strong> Featured by two national newspapers; open-sourced.</div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">data viz</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\" id=\"about\">\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <p class=\"small muted\">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p>\n      <h2>Good design starts with listening.</h2>\n      <p>I’m Mira Kovač, a product designer based in Ljubljana. I work across research, interaction design and front-end prototyping to make essential services easier to use.</p>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">What I bring</h3>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Interaction design</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">User research</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Design systems</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Prototyping</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Service design</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <blockquote class=\"card stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin:0\">\n      <span class=\"quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Mira turned a tangle of requirements into something our riders actually enjoy using.</p>\n      <footer><strong>Tina Zupan</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Head of Digital, LPP</span></footer>\n    </blockquote>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card row between center gap-lg\" id=\"contact\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <p class=\"small muted\">HAVE A THOUGHTFUL PROJECT IN MIND?</p>\n      <h2>Let’s make it clearer.</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Open to freelance work from January. Get in touch and tell me what you’re working on.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn\" href=\"mailto:mira@example.com\">mira@example.com</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">FIND ME ELSEWHERE</span>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Dribbble</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">LinkedIn</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Read.cv</span>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Ljubljana · Product designer</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n    <span class=\"small muted\">© Mira Kovač</span>\n    <a class=\"small muted\" href=\"#top\">Back to top ↑</a>\n  </footer>\n</main>","deltas":[[7120,"<style"],[7127,">\n"],[7136," "],[7140," ."],[7143,"portfolio"],[7147,"-"],[7155,"hero"],[7162," {"],[7165," padding"],[7168,":"],[7171," clamp"],[7178,"("],[7183,"1"],[7189,"."],[7192,"5"],[7196,"rem"],[7205,","],[7209," "],[7211,"5"],[7218,"vw"],[7220,","],[7222," "],[7228,"4"],[7234,"rem"],[7237,");"],[7240," border"],[7243,"-radius"],[7245,":"],[7248," "],[7255,"1"],[7257,"."],[7260,"5"],[7263,"rem"],[7265,";"],[7269," background"],[7277,":"],[7281," linear"],[7283,"-gradient"],[7289,"("],[7293,"135"],[7296,"deg"],[7300,","],[7304," rgba"],[7309,"("],[7313,"65"],[7318,","],[7323," "],[7329,"116"],[7331,","],[7334," "],[7337,"94"],[7347,","],[7350," ."],[7355,"14"],[7359,"),"],[7362," rgba"],[7365,"("],[7370,"65"],[7377,","],[7382," "],[7384,"116"],[7387,","],[7391," "],[7392,"94"],[7396,","],[7398," ."],[7401,"035"],[7408,")"],[7411," "],[7416,"58"],[7421,"%,"],[7428," transparent"],[7432,");"],[7436," }\n"],[7442," "],[7444," ."],[7445,"portfolio"],[7449,"-mark"],[7451," {